# Every env file except the checked-in template. The narrow `.env` rule was not
# enough: a stray `.env.bak`, created by a backup command, fell outside it and
# was committed with real credentials in it. Ignore the whole family and allow
# back only the template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

rehearsal-*.md
.DS_Store

# Working notes and drafts stay out of the repo entirely. The README is the
# only documentation this project ships.
docs/
